\f31506\fs22\lang1031\langfe1033\kerning2\cgrid\langnp1031\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \lang1033\langfe1033\langnp1033\insrsid3361506\charrsid3361506 # Team Matcher \emdash  Bug Report (Task 6 / May 2026 modules)
\par 
\par Result of an extensive, source-level bug hunt focused on the modules written or
\par changed in **May 2026** (`violations.py`, the Task 6 views in `views.py`,
\par `models.py`). 12 genuine defects, each with an exact location, severity, root cause,
\par reproduction, and a suggested fix.
\par 
\par | Property | Value |
\par |---|---|
\par | Branch | `feature/task-6-req` (HEAD `1fe8a59`) |
\par | Scope | May 2026 code only (Task 6). Pre-existing Dec-2025 bugs excluded except where Task 6 re-exposes them. |
\par | Method | Full read of the relevant source; thresholds verified with NumPy; concurrency reasoned from the code. |
\par | Honesty note | Where a defect is reasoned (concurrency, PostgreSQL advisory locks) rather than executed, it is labelled. I could not run a live server here. |
\par 
\par > **Severity key:** **High** = wrong result or crash on a realistic path \'b7
